            <sparkle:version>0.18.34</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.18.34</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.18.34</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>The anonymous usage counts count right</strong> — a key shot was counted as a fire from the menu, a second action in a pill&#x27;s own seat as a first one, and a folder shown as a strip or as its own menu was not counted at all. A menu that an app&#x27;s rule refused no longer counts as an open.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
