        <item>
            <title>0.18.32</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:44:00 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.18.32</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.18.32</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.18.32</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>New installs: the finger switch starts off</strong> — 0.18.31 turned <strong>Only with a finger on the trackpad</strong> on for new installs by mistake, so a key tap could open nothing. It now starts off, as intended. If you installed 0.18.31 fresh, switch it off in Settings, in the card <strong>Single keys</strong>.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
